  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 3.5 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New Features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Developers can optionally provide a single deep-link URL for a custom project page by adding a `deepLink` attribute to `Attributes-data.dictionary`. For more information, see `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/create-custom-product-pages/configure-multiple-product-page-versions`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppCustomProductPageVersionCreateRequest/Data-data.dictionary/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/create-custom-product-pages/configure-multiple-product-page-versions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`ELAPSED_TIME_CENTISECOND` is now available in `GameCenterLeaderboardFormatter`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterLeaderboardFormatter"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Developers can now more easily debug slow-launch issues for their app with the new `LAUNCHES diagnosticType` for `GET-v1-builds-_id_-diagnosticSignatures`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-builds-_id_-diagnosticSignatures"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Trending insights for disk writes signatures are now available and show the impact of\u00A0signature trends across app versions.\u00A0`GET-v1-builds-_id_-diagnosticSignatures` now includes the\u00A0`DiagnosticInsightDirection`,\u00A0`DiagnosticInsightType`,\u00A0and an impact breakdown by app version.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-builds-_id_-diagnosticSignatures"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A new attribute `BetaTesterState` is available for `Attributes-data.dictionary`. For more information, see `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/view-and-manage-tester-information`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/BetaTester/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/view-and-manage-tester-information"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The `IMAGE_MANAGER` role is now removed from `UserRole`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/UserRole"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `priceTier` is now removed from `GET-v2-inAppPurchases-_id_-pricePoints`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v2-inAppPurchases-_id_-pricePoints"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
